Chant the glory of the Moons, granting you stealth detection ([+13, +18, +22, +25, +28 (TL1-5; SP 100)] power), and invisibility detection ([+13, +18, +22, +25, +28 (TL1-5; SP 100)] power).

You may also attack creatures you cannot see without penalty and your critical hits do [28%, 38%, 46%, 52%, 58% (TL1-5; SP 100)] more damage.

You may only have one Hymn active at once.

The stealth and invisibility detection will increase with your Spellpower.
